# Per-repo scope list for conventional-git.
# One scope per line. Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
# Delete or rename this file to fall back to the global default scope list.
#
# Keep this list short and stable — it's the vocabulary for your commit
# and branch naming. Drift creates noise (e.g. "s3" vs "aws" vs "storage").

api
cli
ci
config
deps
docs
tests
